":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Scope section — 'src/rebar/metrics/ (new lens module + registry registration)'","norm_id":"ndc863bf64ba6ab7c","priority":0.0,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","scenarios":[],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"In Scope, expand `src/rebar/metrics/` to explicitly include `__init__.py` — add the new lens module to the side-effect import list on line 18 alongside `event_metrics, git_metrics, sidecar_metrics`, and expose a `register()` that appends the spec(s) idempotently on id.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.1667,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"na","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"dropped","drop_reason":null,"evidence":[],"finding":"The plan never states whether bug_trends honors the ctx since/until range. The metrics CLI always threads a range (default last 30 days) into ctx, and existing bug/event metrics filter on it. If bug_trends respects the range, the default 30-day window excludes essentially all 344 historical closed bugs and empties the 214-bug pre-convention era-skew cohort the plan is built to surface; if it ignores the range, that deliberate deviation from every sibling metric needs to be stated.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f20fef7f11db824cf","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach / Context; Testing ('mixed-era stores')","norm_id":"n050c52ee0925c67c","priority":0.0,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","scenarios":[],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.1667,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"na","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Restate the caused_by fan-in dimension in terms of its real key: incoming caused_by edge count per TARGET TICKET id (culprit change/ticket), not 'components'; note it counts across all bugs regardless of range (stock).","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"advisory","drop_reason":"novelty","evidence":["src/rebar/metrics/blame.py:126-129 — derive_caused_by resolves the top blamed commit to a TICKET id (the culprit), returning that id","docs/ticket-model.md:120 — 'caused_by | id1 (a bug) was caused by the change/ticket id2'","graph/_graph.py:204 — caused_by is a directional link between ticket ids"],"finding":"The Context frames caused_by fan-in as 'which COMPONENTS spawn bugs', but a caused_by edge targets a change/ticket id (a culprit ticket), never a component/module. blame.derive_caused_by returns a resolved TICKET id, and ticket-model.md defines caused_by as 'id1 (a bug) was caused by the change/ticket id2'. Grouping fan-in by 'component' has no field to key on; the dimension actually measures per-culprit-ticket fan-in.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f32f669417de731ff","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Context/Problem ('caused_by fan-in (which components spawn bugs)') + Approach ('caused_by link fan-in per target')","norm_id":"n96d3fee9eed726f0","priority":0.165,"reason":"default-advisory","scenarios":["Implementer reads 'which components spawn bugs' and tries to bucket fan-in by a component/path attribute the caused_by target does not carry, or mislabels the output; the correct, buildable measure is count of incoming caused_by edges per target TICKET id"],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Reword Context/Approach to 'caused_by fan-in = number of incoming caused_by edges per culprit ticket id (the change/ticket most bugs are attributed to)'.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.625,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"low","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}}],"impact_mod